&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is seeking an experienced Regional Services Partner to lead our Enterprise &amp;amp; Public Sector Services business in the MENA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of commercial ownership, customer engagement, and delivery excellence. You will be responsible for driving services bookings growth while ensuring successful execution of a portfolio of complex engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Regional Services Leader, you will partner closely with Enterprise &amp;amp; Public Sector Account Executives, Solution Architects, Delivery teams, and Customer Success to define and execute tailored services strategies that accelerate time to value and drive long-term adoption of Elastic solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means consistently achieving Services bookings and revenue targets while delivering predictable, high-quality outcomes for&amp;nbsp; customers.&lt;/p&gt;
